msgstr "每个组内 pct_change 的位置数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.pct_change:5 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) for pct_change.  If None, all non-group-key columns are "
"transformed."
msgstr "用于 pct_change 的列。如果为 None，则所有非分组键列都会被转换。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.pct_change.rst
