#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.pct_change:15 of
msgid ""
"Grouped transforms hash-shuffle rows by group key, so the output row "
"order follows reducer/hash-partition order and is **not** aligned with "
"the input frame (unlike pandas, which preserves the index). Row count is "
"preserved. Order restoration via a place-back operator "
"(``LiteFrameIlocSetItem``) is planned; see "
"``docs/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``."
msgstr ""
"分组转换通过分组键对行进行哈希洗牌，因此输出行顺序遵循 reducer/哈希分区"
"顺序，并且与输入框架**不对齐**（不像 pandas 那样保留索引）。行数保持不变"
"。计划通过 place-back 操作符（``LiteFrameIlocSetItem``）恢复顺序；参见 ``"
"docs/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.pct_change:22 of
msgid ""
"Null-key rows are preserved with a null result (matching pandas "
"``groupby.shift()`` under the default ``dropna=True``); they are not "
"grouped together."
msgstr ""
"空键行会保留空结果（匹配 pandas 在默认 ``dropna=True`` 下的 ``groupby."
"shift()``）；它们不会被分组在一起。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.pct_change.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

